    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "healing and self-discovery sounds like something for people who still have something to build on. but there's nothing left to build. it's like i'm just a ghost watching everyone else live their lives. it feels like the version of me that mattered is just dead, and this thing left behind is just... a mistake. why even keep trying to fix something that isn't even there anymore?",
      "source": "evaluator"
