    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "let go to what, though? you say it's okay to accept it, but it just feels like everyone is expecting me to keep performing this role of \"person\" when there's nothing inside. it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy, useless body through a life i don't even want anymore. if the \"me\" that mattered is gone, then what's the point in the struggle? it almost feels like the most logical thing would just be to stop.",
